e = bypassed) - the workflow is a\nplain single-image editor until you need it.\nEnable: right-click this group's title bar -> toggle Bypass off.\nOrder rule: scene = image 1 (group 1), person = image 2 (here)."],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":103,"type":"Note","pos":[1620,360],"size":[620,300],"flags":{},"order":5,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Writing instructions","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"Note"},"widgets_values":["Write the edit in plain English:\n  'Relight the scene with warm golden hour sunlight.'\n  'Place this person at the cafe table, holding a coffee.'\n  'Change her outfit to a red raincoat.'\n\nUnique face coming out generic? Append:\n  'Preserve the exact facial identity - distinguishing features: ...'\nand describe what makes the face distinctive.\n\ngrounding_px: how large the model 'sees' the input while reading your\ninstruction. 384-768 is the trained range. Getting doubled/split\ncompositions? LOWER it. The collapsed node below is the negative -\nonly used at CFG > 1; keep its prompt empty."],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":104,"type":"Note","pos":[2320,230],"size":[420,420],"flags":{},"order":6,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Fidelity dial","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"Note"},"widgets_values":["THE FIDELITY DIAL (ref_boost) - how hard the model looks at your\nreference. New in this release.\n\n  1.0 = classic v1.1 behavior\n  4.0 = recommended (pre-set): much stronger face + body likeness,\n        more reliable edits\n  >10 = over-copy: removals/replacements start failing\n  <1  = suppress the reference (creative freedom)\n\nref_boost_a: the scene dial (image 1) in two-image mode -\nleave at 1.0 unless you are exploring. ref_boost applies to the\nperson (image 2) when group 2 is enabled, else to your image.\n\nfit_mode: how inputs fit a different output aspect\nratio. fit = resample to the output shape (default, recommended); crop (legacy) = center-crop\nonly for v1/v1.1 weights."],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":105,"type":"Note","pos":[2800,490],"size":[320,280],"flags":{},"order":7,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Sampling","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"Note"},"widgets_values":["Turbo model: 10 steps, cfg 1.\n\nStep dial:\n  8  = stronger composition/instruction adherence\n  12 = more face detail\n  10 = balanced\n\nUsing krea2_raw instead of turbo:\n40 steps, cfg 3-4 (negative then matters)."],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":107,"type":"Note","pos":[1250,-140],"size":[270,110],"flags":{},"order":8,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Resolution","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"Note"},"widgets_values":["Output resolution. 1MP is the\nsweet spot; go higher only for\nsingle-person edits."],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":71,"type":"LoraLoaderModelOnly","pos":[60,370],"size":[480,120],"flags":{},"order":14,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"model","name":"model","type":"MODEL","link":1},{"localized_name":"lora_name","name":"lora_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"lora_name"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"strength_model","name":"strength_model","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"strength_model"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"MODEL","name":"MODEL","type":"MODEL","links":[2]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.26.0","Node name for S&R":"LoraLoaderModelOnly"},"widgets_values":["krea2_identity_edit_v1_2.safetensors",1]},{"id":101,"type":"Note","pos":[648.6044485473634,348.2844116210936],"size":[520,190],"flags":{},"order":9,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"How inputs work","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"Note"},"widgets_values":["YOUR IMAGE - the image being edited (your character, the photo to\nrestyle, the scene...).\n\nTwo-image mode (group 2 enabled): THIS slot is always the SCENE\n(image 1). The person always goes in group 2 (image 2).\nInputs around 1MP work best. Two-person images: stay at/below ~1.5MP."],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":79,"type":"Krea2Edi